                        "username": "Alpana07"
                    },
                    "message": "I think \"updateDbusProperty\" function name is sufficient for this task.\nReading and comparing the value is internal way to decide we need update or not.\n\nreadDbusProperty seems to return the read value."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/dbus_utility.hpp",
