                        "username": "RekhaAparna01"
                    },
                    "message": "if i_propertyValue and *l_currentValue are equal this API returns false, indicates failure in updating the value. But it should return true as there is no update?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/dbus_utility.hpp",
